cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "zh-ipi-bench: A Chinese-native benchmark for indirect prompt injection"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Wu"
    given-names: "Jiacheng"
abstract: >-
  A Chinese-native benchmark for indirect prompt injection (instructions hidden in
  issues, documents, emails, web pages and tool outputs), with Chinese-specific
  obfuscations, benign hard negatives, a detector evaluation harness, and an end-to-end
  test of architectural isolation. Code is MIT; data is CC BY 4.0.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/JiachengWu591/zh-ipi-bench"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/JiachengWu591/zh-ipi-bench"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - indirect prompt injection
  - LLM security
  - Chinese
  - benchmark
